{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_gvial2_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_gvial2_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"以酒精之名！","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_gvial2_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"e60f5acbe25e460518f34f4fa203cb3ccae5c63126d9cfbcf9bbbc79d6d89bba","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿卡胡拉和際崖城的杜林人就拜託你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆，這次你不走不行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆，不要走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼傻話，我不走不行啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......依娜姆，我會想你的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你們搞什麼啊，好像我一去不復返了一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你說這次離開的時間會比較長......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"事關王酋的人選，麻煩事堆起來比祖瑪瑪的大醜還要高，我當然不敢保證說明天就能回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我越來越覺得自己來當王酋這個決定真是太正確了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，阿卡胡拉還有際崖城的杜林人就都拜託你了，嘉維爾。我不在的這段時間裡，請你當好他們的領導。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具體需要我做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都不做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，讓我維持現狀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"阿卡胡拉一直是這個樣子。至於從際崖城來的那些杜林人，他們正在加緊建設聚落，甚至還投票決定暫時禁酒以提高工作效率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禁酒？杜林人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我也嚇了一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"但這就是他們投票得出的結果。看來他們其實也是很明白輕重緩急的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"按照這個勢頭，在我回來之前，杜林人的聚落應該就能建成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你的工作，就是讓這裡和我在時一樣。這對大家都很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，當務之急還是杜林人聚落的事，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"（懷疑的眼神）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"順便一說，杜林人的釀酒工具被我藏在......（耳語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"千萬不能讓他們找到，明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然藏得這麼隱蔽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？是什麼地方，我也想知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那些杜林人一遇到和酒沾邊的事就鬼精鬼精的，要把地點從你嘴裡詐出來簡直就是分分鐘的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說來，連我也不告訴不是更好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......畢竟是要去和那些薩爾貢宮廷的傢伙打交道，我還是得做一些準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一我一年半載回不來，那些杜林人一直喝不到家鄉風味的酒，也怪可憐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我再跟你們說說其他注意事項......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，我們這樣真的好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不就是幫杜林人找點合用的木材，有什麼好不好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可依娜姆讓我們“什麼都不做”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，我還以為你要說什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說的是不要改變她定下來的規矩，不是讓我們什麼都不幹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，看到那些杜林人熱火朝天的樣子，不幫他們幹點什麼，我自己都覺得說不過去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是嘉維爾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是從際崖城來的杜林人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也像斯第奇之前那樣迷路了嗎？我送你回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，我來是有話想跟你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管有什麼話都回去再說吧，這片雨林不太安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，這裡最安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我是蜜釀協會的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是禁酒的事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼通情達理真是太好了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打住，這事免談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼堅決？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禁酒令是你們自己投票通過的，你真有意見，應該去找自己人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但釀酒工具交給依娜姆保存了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，依娜姆又沒告訴我她把釀酒工具放在哪裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？只有她一個人知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎麼能這樣呢，萬一她自己也忘了，際崖城的蜜酒豈不是再也回不來了，真不負責任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆才沒有不負責任呢！她把藏釀酒工具的地方告訴嘉維爾了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦豁，完蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，我就知道，依娜姆才不會做出這種不負責任的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是就是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我是不會告訴你們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，看來今天是不行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們是不會放棄的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市要從一磚一瓦建起，釀酒工具的下落也要一點一點挖掘出來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，嘉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了一些緊急情況，我不得不來此地把你探訪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為缺乏一些......生活必需品，我的同胞們情緒低落，夜不能寐，如同被幽靈纏繞一般，痛苦萬分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好可憐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我為著緩和他們的苦楚來找你求助了，令人尊敬的嘉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，我們幫幫他們吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，不要在我的名字前面加亂七八糟的形容詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，讓我猜猜，你說的生活必需品一定是蜜釀，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡直是一派胡言！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那種低劣的兒童飲料，如何能與高貴的七號烈酒等量齊觀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正你們都喝不到，我覺得差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，狠心的嘉維爾，你怎能如此鐵石心腸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在控訴我的鐵石心腸之前，你能先把這個怪裡怪氣的說話腔調改掉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，很怪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為模仿阿芙朵嘉筆下的人物說話，和地上人溝通會更有效率一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒有。請你好好說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有烈酒喝我要死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忍著！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，請問依娜姆把釀酒工具藏到哪裡去了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執著的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，釀酒工具被藏到哪去了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"絮叨的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，釀酒工具......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，嘉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪？見到你真高興。終於能有人和我聊些酒精以外的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"（僵住）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有種不祥的預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"杜林人的釀酒工具......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼連你也跟著他們起哄啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他們答應我，一拿到釀酒工具就派他們協會的技工來，幫我用杜林科技調試機器人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，他們連你都動員起來了，這我可真沒想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還找誰了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"他們去找過特米米，但是被轟出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"耶奇·地心長老和際崖城的其他人他們也去找過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"他們自己說的，除了阿芙朵嘉之外，其他人的態度都有些鬆動，至少是......曖昧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曖昧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"據說，就連一開始厲行禁酒的耶奇長老自己，現在也已經有點被他們說動了。畢竟我們也見識過際崖城裡的酒有多暢銷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣下去絕對不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來一味地跟這些傢伙糾纏下去已經不是個辦法了。他們自己頒佈的禁酒令，當然也可以自己推翻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真走到那一步，杜林聚落離建成怕是就遙遙無期了......我可不想等依娜姆回來之後，給她展示全阿卡胡拉獨一無二的爛尾建築群！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......哇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你肯定也不想那樣吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是無所謂......不過我聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把特米米也叫來吧，我們一起商量一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦啊嘉維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，你冷靜一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在就去找耶奇長老，讓他不要改口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停、停、停，回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛和嘉維爾聊過了。耶奇長老自己也不是不喝酒，現在去找他多半不是個好主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的能在禁酒這件事上不打折扣的恐怕只有阿芙朵嘉，但禁酒涉及到杜林人的切身利益，她恐怕也無能為力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我有個主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？嘉維爾，我就知道，你一定行的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也別這麼興奮，光靠我一個人肯定不成，我還需要你們來幫幫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，麻煩你發動一下各個部落的人，讓他們盯著點杜林人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？他們要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就和祖瑪瑪的任務息息相關了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經多少天沒有酒喝了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經懶得數了，烈酒瘋子。我只記得你們派出去遊說的人全都無功而返，比源石蟲還難看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蜜釀軟蛋，你說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我警告你，你侮辱我們的人可以，侮辱老卡爾蜜釀不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你們才是被烈酒裡的腳臭味薰壞了腦子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一向是主張你們兩派和平共處的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有話快說，喜歡喝漿果番茄酒的怪胎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實耶奇長老已經快被我們的人說動了，只要再忍兩三天，就兩三天——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，陰謀家們，你們好啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱愛酒精的杜林人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來談條件的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼條件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你們想拿回釀酒工具，而且已經快等不及了，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來給你們指一條明路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你們擊敗我，我就把工具原樣奉還。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？我打——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真打算就這麼開打？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我想我還是需要一些準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明智的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重申一遍，只要你們中有哪個能擊敗我，我立刻把釀酒工具交給他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊那個，對，說你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偷襲可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是哪個人想偷襲我，他恐怕就要終身戒酒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，偷襲這種事也太不光明磊落了一點，你說是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我、我、我們是不會屈服的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，很有骨氣，不愧是阿卡胡拉的新居民！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊做準備去吧！只要你們想打，我隨時奉陪！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪，你那邊怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"很順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"他們一開始以為只要稍微努力一下，籌集點裝備什麼的就能打過你，顯然是想簡單了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天他們連連打敗仗，就開始找別的辦法。我很輕鬆地把他們的注意力吸引到機械上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我把大醜的圖紙借給了他們，和他們展開了一波深入的技術交流，不得不說，杜林人的技術真的很讓人感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的自走車看起來有點瞎，但裡面的技術都是真傢伙，一旦投入使用可不得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒是好事......不過我擔心的是，他們該不會搞出一個搭載了杜林科技的自走車大醜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"他們好像就是這個思路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（聳肩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，我們本來就計畫好的，想借著這個機會讓杜林人嘗試一下，看看能不能開發一些適合搞建設的機械。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，我這幾天和那些杜林人簡直不能叫打架，就是扮家家酒。現在你告訴我有個大醜級別的對手，也挺不錯的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，不好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？怎麼了，杜林人因為喝酒的事內訌了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，蜜釀協會的人差一點就和喜歡七號烈酒的人打了起來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，我不是說這個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，他們做出了一台不輸大醜的機械，正在搞武器試射！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪的任務就是這個，忘了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......我白擔心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我繼續去旁觀他們搞武器試射了！乒乒乓乓的，看起來真的很厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧去吧，如果感覺有什麼不對的地方再來找我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，他們在哪裡搞武器試射的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森蚺部落北邊不遠處的一個洞窟下面，那裡除了樹什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森蚺部落北邊......洞窟——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，你快去制止他們，我和祖瑪瑪隨後就到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是武器試射嗎，你怎麼突然這麼緊張？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆把他們的釀酒工具藏在那個洞窟裡了啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈——欠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉......嘉維爾？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，請你們換個地方試驗武器，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你說的，只要我們能打敗你，就能拿回釀酒工具！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒是沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你現在為什麼要阻攔我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這——我來不是為了別的，只是想讓你們換個地方試驗這台......這台......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨大的終極醜東西Mk3！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我只是想讓這台巨大的終極醜東西Mk3換個地方試驗，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經是我們能找到的最合適的地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，為了擊敗你，我們已經付出了沉重的代價！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉重的代價？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們熬了三天三夜，但這不是最重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是，我們甚至還和蜜釀軟蛋聯手了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！我們甚至還和烈酒瘋子聯手了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......原來這個才是最重要的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，我們付出了如此慘重的代價，怎麼可能因為你的一句話就放棄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我只是想讓你們換個地方而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，就是不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）嘉維爾，這倒不怪他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）阿芙朵嘉讓他們找個不會打擾別人的地方，還威脅他們，要是打擾到別人，以後就不幫他們的酒寫廣告了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）所以他們才找到這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我剛才也看到了好多固定好的設備和器械，已經搬不走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）這下頭疼了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）要不然我就跟他們說，讓他們不要在武器試射的過程中波及那個洞窟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不等於明擺著告訴他們裡面有東西嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請回吧，嘉維爾，不要繼續妨礙我們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你覺得自己打不過巨大的終極醜東西Mk3，這才跑來干擾我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這我可不能當沒聽見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......總、總之，你請回吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最後再申明一次，我是從你們的利益出發，勸你們換個位置的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不會走的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——麻煩死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不這樣，我們的對決提前吧，就在這裡開打，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）嘉維爾，你這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）與其放著他們在這狂轟濫炸把山洞炸塌，還不如讓我控制一下局勢，放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們的武器還沒調試好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次如果我輸了，我立刻就把工具原樣奉還，如果我贏了，你們還有繼續挑戰的機會，怎麼想都不虧吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像......好像也是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘉維爾三步並作兩步跑到巨大機械的南邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你怎麼跑到這邊來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊是洞窟和峭壁，我也得給自己留點騰挪的空間吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像也有點道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就開打吧，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那我不客氣了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好強的火力，幾乎沒法近身......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒完呢！杜林式伐木圓鋸，啟動！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是還不夠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，竟然憑一己之力頂住了超大功率引擎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，回避，快回避！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然躲開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"設計得還挺靈巧，有考慮過把它用在建設聚落上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打完再說吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃我這一炮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用斧頭擋住了炮彈？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是祖瑪瑪替我打造的斧頭，要對付幾枚炮彈，簡直小菜一碟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在該我了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完了！後退，快後退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休想！鏈鋸來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後退什麼，這裡該橫移！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，應該前進，只有以進為退才能閃開鏈鋸的攻擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別搶，你們別搶遙控器——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這詭異的移動路徑——怎麼又繞到我後面去了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個老實點，剛剛差點要輸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你無路可逃了，嘉維爾，吃我的終極攻擊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜林式失能導彈全方位蓄力轟炸！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，山洞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼偏偏在這時候搞什麼全方位轟炸啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘉維爾深吸一口氣，尾巴一鬆，鏈鋸鏘啷一聲掉在地上。\n她用雙手握緊那柄巨斧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，她、她、她跳了多高？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘉維爾一躍而起，攀上了巨大機械的足，然後是腹。\n借著一處水平面，嘉維爾再次跳起，尾巴捲上機器人高高舉起的機械臂，把自己甩到了對面的山洞口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嗖嗖嗖——\n嘉維爾看著鋪天蓋地的彈頭，舉起了手中的巨斧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈、哈、哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸虧是全方位轟炸，沒幾個彈頭往這邊來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也多謝你們沒在導彈裡裝什麼炸藥......總算下手還有點輕重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道你為什麼這麼關心那個洞口，但吃了我們的失能導彈，你已經不可能再站得住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"導彈裡面灌滿了阿達克利斯釀的酒，就算是我們之中最能喝的人，也不可能在挨炸之後保持站立！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你覺得我現在躺著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失能導彈怎麼會對你無效？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，導彈裡才多少酒啊，而且又不是喝進去的，吸入一點點頂多就是微醺，怎麼可能站不起來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只能說你們酒量不大好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（猛搓自己的臉）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不甚客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個先不說！嘉維爾，你為什麼那麼在乎那個山洞！裡面是不是有什麼阻止我們拿回釀酒工具的不可告人的秘密！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，事到如今，我就告訴你們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆把你們的釀酒工具藏在裡面了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱愛酒精的杜林人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不信可以自己去看——當然，在你們打倒我之前，我不會讓你們拿走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣起來的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......所以你剛才跳到上面去，是為了保護我們的釀酒工具不被導彈擊中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳起來的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你在開打之前跑到巨大的終極醜東西Mk3後面，是怕戰鬥波及那個山洞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒起來的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你趕我們去別的地方，是怕武器試驗把釀酒工具打壞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛不是說了嗎，我是從你們的利益出發，才跑來讓你們換個位置的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱愛酒精的杜林人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾......你的尾巴好像在流血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才用尾巴在機器上借力，好像被上面的什麼尖刺劃了個口子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏銳的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你臉上也有傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟打了這麼痛快的一場架，沒傷才不正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還要接著打嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們還想打，我繼續奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是......再等幾天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也覺得這樣比較好，畢竟你們的這個終極攻擊對我好像沒什麼用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這段時間我會派人嚴密看守這個山洞的，不打敗我就把東西拿回去，這種事想都不要想！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，巨大的終極醜東西Mk3也來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是Mk4了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯，更新換代的速度還蠻快的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就在這開打吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杜林人手裡拿著遙控器，既不看嘉維爾，也不看巨大的機械，而是仰頭看天，嘴裡念念有詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾這樣，我就這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這樣，嘉維爾就那樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾那樣，我就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杜林人卡了一會，頭低了下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們現在開始？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，開始吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘉維爾擺開架勢，等著巨大的機械發動攻擊。\n杜林人也在這時按下了手上的遙控器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的爆炸過後，嘉維爾毫髮無損。\n她目瞪口呆地看著眼前被炸成一堆破銅爛鐵的機械。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這——這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"經過上次一戰，我們在許多地方做出了改進，但嚴謹的試驗表明，即使做出了那麼多改進，巨大的終極醜東西系列還是沒法戰勝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是我只能想到最後一招，就是自爆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不應該一開局就自爆吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因為我剛剛還在盤算你的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我發現，即使是自爆也沒法打贏你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客氣的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了表示心服口服，我只能這麼做了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我還等著祖瑪瑪把它改造成工業機器人呢！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎回來，依娜姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看起來精神不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆，你回來得這麼快，事情一定很順利吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"確實很順利。多虧了我們的那些前期準備，宮廷對阿卡胡拉毫無興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這邊怎麼樣？一切照常？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，一切照常！杜林人的禁酒令被嘉維爾維持得很好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來很不錯嘛，嘉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"和杜林人打交道的感覺怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們看起來又一意孤行又愛出洋相，實際上是群不錯的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是怎麼擺平那些吵著要喝酒的杜林人的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主要是用拳頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你把他們打了一頓？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾才沒這麼做！嘉維爾和他們約好了，誰能打贏嘉維爾，誰就能拿回釀酒工具，但他們都輸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"原、原來是這麼一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"這和把他們打了一頓好像也差不多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還是先回去看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆，你回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，看看這個，這是我們比賽的傳單！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"比賽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，比賽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清醒的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還要和蜜釀協會的同伴們商討戰略，就不多奉陪了。再見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"第三屆......巨大的終極醜東西杯......自走機械對戰選拔賽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"勝者的作品將和嘉維爾決一勝負......擊敗嘉維爾即可奪回釀酒工具......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆，你臉色不太好。頭痛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，畢竟這段時間都是嘉維爾主事，我已經有心理準備了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去看看杜林聚落吧。既然他們玩得這麼瘋，一定已經都建好了吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，那不是際崖城的天氣預報長老嘛，他也來跟大家同樂了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，阿芙朵嘉，我已經進半決賽了，只要再打一輪，就一輪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆？那邊的是依娜姆吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總算回來了！快幫我勸勸耶奇長老，讓他號召大家別再玩什麼自走機器人對戰了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"別告訴我，你是為了給杜林人戒酒才舉辦的這個什麼選拔賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實......也差不多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那杜林人的聚落呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一台巨大的機械隆隆駛來。\n幾個杜林人和機械保持著相當可觀的安全距離，控制著機械從二人面前經過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那個好像把自走車和大醜融合起來的怪裡怪氣的機械是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得杜林人取的名字叫“巨大的終極醜東西Mk5”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這東西還是打不過我，但在祖瑪瑪和黛柯綺·銀幣他們的努力之下，已經是合格的工業機器人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是晚回來兩天，杜林聚落就完工了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為我在做夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，打我一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"這居然是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，嘉維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一屆選拔賽的勝者已經決出，杜林人已經吵著要你去和他們的冠軍對決了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，依娜姆，要來看一場久違的阿卡胡拉對決嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"樂意之至。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
